00:16:04.997 --> 00:16:08.034
You got that right.

00:16:08.234 --> 00:16:10.102
Who are you anyway?

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:11.537
Me?

00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:13.473
I am...

00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:16.008
My name is...

00:16:16.742 --> 00:16:19.846
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo!

00:16:22.381 --> 00:16:25.051
Take my Fist of the Fart!

00:16:25.551 --> 00:16:27.386
Why the heck are you wearing my clothes?

00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:29.222
And you can call me...

00:16:30.323 --> 00:16:32.124
Don Patch!

00:16:33.326 --> 00:16:38.064
So you've come, Don Patch!
I'll defeat you with my Fist of the Fart!

00:16:38.064 --> 00:16:40.533
I'll eat you! I'll eat you!

00:16:41.033 --> 00:16:42.969
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:16:42.969 --> 00:16:44.670
It smells good! It smells good!

00:16:44.804 --> 00:16:46.639
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:16:46.706 --> 00:16:48.841
It smells good! It smells good!

00:16:48.841 --> 00:16:50.610
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.812
It smells good! It smells good!

00:16:52.812 --> 00:16:54.547
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:16:54.814 --> 00:16:56.682
It smells good! It smells good!

00:16:56.682 --> 00:16:58.484
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:16:58.484 --> 00:17:00.620
It smells good! It smells good!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.455
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:17:02.555 --> 00:17:04.657
It smells good! It smells good!

00:17:04.657 --> 00:17:06.626
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:17:06.626 --> 00:17:08.594
It smells good! It smells good!

00:17:08.594 --> 00:17:10.496
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:17:10.496 --> 00:17:12.732
It smells good! It smells good!

00:17:13.165 --> 00:17:16.302
Now, all of you watching the TV, join in!

00:17:16.302 --> 00:17:18.304
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:17:18.304 --> 00:17:20.273
It smells good! It smells good!

00:17:20.273 --> 00:17:22.241
Toot toot! Toot toot!

00:17:22.241 --> 00:17:24.210
It smells good! It smells good!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:36.722
- Toot toot! Toot toot!
- It smells good! It smells good!

00:17:39.225 --> 00:17:41.561
Everyone thinks I'm some kind of joke...

00:17:41.827 --> 00:17:43.095
Quit making fun of me!

00:17:49.669 --> 00:17:51.470
Calm down, Boy A.

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:52.505
Let me go!

00:17:55.775 --> 00:17:58.644
That must be the Fist of the Nose Hair!

00:18:02.615 --> 00:18:04.050
How could this be?

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:08.187
To think that someone besides the boss
could use the Fist of the Nose Hair!

00:18:12.725 --> 00:18:16.662
I have to return and
report this to the boss.

00:18:29.475 --> 00:18:32.645
Hello, I'd like to hail a taxi.

00:18:32.645 --> 00:18:36.015
Yes. #813 will arrive in about 3 seconds.

00:18:37.984 --> 00:18:40.653
Some urgent business has come
up, so I'm getting out of here.

00:18:40.653 --> 00:18:41.721
What?!

00:18:42.121 --> 00:18:43.289
Thank you for waiting.

00:18:43.289 --> 00:18:44.957
Our fight is on our tea soup...

00:18:44.957 --> 00:18:47.493
I mean... on hold, Heppokomaru!

00:18:47.827 --> 00:18:49.729
Wiggin' Out

00:18:49.729 --> 00:18:52.732
Wiggin' Out Excuse me, could
you take me to Shinjuku Station?

00:18:52.732 --> 00:18:53.299
Wiggin' Out
Got it.

00:18:53.299 --> 00:18:53.633
Got it.

00:19:02.475 --> 00:19:05.311
So, Mr. Driver, how's business?

00:19:05.311 --> 00:19:06.579
Alright, I guess.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:11.050
Patch

00:19:13.152 --> 00:19:15.821
This vehicle is turning left.

00:19:16.555 --> 00:19:17.723
Please be cautious.

00:19:18.057 --> 00:19:21.961
Um... Aren't we going in circles?

00:19:22.428 --> 00:19:24.497
We're almost at Shinjuku, sir.

00:19:24.964 --> 00:19:27.366
How is that taxi going to get anywhere?

00:19:32.471 --> 00:19:33.272
Beauty!

00:19:33.839 --> 00:19:34.840
Hey, Beauty!

00:19:36.475 --> 00:19:37.743
Wake up, Beauty!

00:19:41.881 --> 00:19:45.084
Huh? When did I...

00:19:48.354 --> 00:19:49.822
Right. I remember now.

00:19:50.122 --> 00:19:53.926
I got bored of Bo-bobo and Don Patch...

00:19:55.327 --> 00:19:56.996
and I fell asleep.

00:19:58.464 --> 00:20:00.733
Wallman's left.

00:20:03.636 --> 00:20:05.171
Let's leave too.

00:20:05.905 --> 00:20:07.173
We can leave?

00:20:07.606 --> 00:20:08.541
Wait!

00:20:08.674 --> 00:20:10.843
| have a request for you!

00:20:18.284 --> 00:20:22.121
Wait! I really need your help!

00:20:23.856 --> 00:20:26.225
Please listen to me!

00:20:26.358 --> 00:20:28.561
Hey, Bo-bobo, are you listening?

00:20:30.029 --> 00:20:31.197
Okay. Let's finish it.

00:20:31.497 --> 00:20:31.964
Click.

00:20:31.964 --> 00:20:32.732
Five!

00:20:33.199 --> 00:20:33.866
Four!

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.201
Three!

00:20:35.401 --> 00:20:35.835
Two!

00:20:36.702 --> 00:20:37.303
One!

00:20:37.903 --> 00:20:38.671
Zero!

00:20:49.982 --> 00:20:51.517
Aren't we shaking?

00:20:51.517 --> 00:20:52.251
Could be.

00:20:52.251 --> 00:20:52.752
Iwasaki Household

00:20:52.752 --> 00:20:55.421
Iwasaki Household
Meanwhile, at Mr. lwasaki's house...

00:20:55.421 --> 00:20:56.722
Iwasaki Household

00:20:56.722 --> 00:21:00.292
Father: lwasaki Yoshio

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:04.830
Mother: lwasaki Masako

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:05.698
Mother: lwasaki Masako
Hiroki!

00:21:05.698 --> 00:21:06.031
Eldest Child: lwasaki Hiroki
Hiroki!

00:21:06.031 --> 00:21:08.667
Eldest Child: lwasaki Hiroki

00:21:10.136 --> 00:21:11.403
Hiroki!

00:21:13.205 --> 00:21:14.473
What is it?

00:21:15.141 --> 00:21:17.042
You had a test today, didn't you?

00:21:19.311 --> 00:21:20.546
How did it go?

00:21:20.846 --> 00:21:22.014
Whaddya mean?

00:21:23.883 --> 00:21:25.384
Your grades!

00:21:25.384 --> 00:21:26.485
Who cares?

00:21:27.086 --> 00:21:29.121
I do.

00:21:30.055 --> 00:21:30.890
Seconds.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.892
60%. I got 60%.

00:21:32.892 --> 00:21:37.229
How can you be satisfied with those grades?
You've been watching too much TV...

00:21:37.229 --> 00:21:38.664
Seconds, mother.

00:21:38.664 --> 00:21:40.132
Get them yourself.

00:21:40.966 --> 00:21:41.567
Okay.

00:21:58.217 --> 00:21:59.785
Doesn't it feel like we're falling?

00:21:59.785 --> 00:22:00.452
Could be.

00:22:19.071 --> 00:22:21.373
So they've finally found me.

00:22:21.807 --> 00:22:24.376
I don't know who they are,
but they must be very good at this.

00:22:25.344 --> 00:22:27.646
| can't stay in this town any longer.

00:22:36.555 --> 00:22:37.489
Sir.

00:22:37.957 --> 00:22:41.760
We've reached Shinjuku.
That'll be 1280 yen.

00:22:47.366 --> 00:22:48.100
Here...

00:22:55.241 --> 00:22:57.142
Sir!

00:22:57.309 --> 00:23:00.412
You're ten yen short!

00:23:01.914 --> 00:23:04.950
And thus...
The Hair Hunters C-Block Base...

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:06.352
was destroyed.

00:23:10.589 --> 00:23:12.024
Let's go, Beauty.

00:23:13.325 --> 00:23:13.993
Yeah.

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.431
Hey! Wait up!

00:23:26.672 --> 00:23:30.743
Softon

00:23:31.043 --> 00:23:33.913
If she's with him, then
| don't have to worry.

00:23:34.513 --> 00:23:37.883
I'm not sure it's much of a relief myself...

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:42.855
But this man named Softon has
felt something about Bo-bobo

00:23:43.122 --> 00:23:45.791
that only those who have fought
Bo-bobo themselves can know.

00:23:46.825 --> 00:23:50.162
Is Softon a friend or foe?

00:23:50.296 --> 00:23:57.803
And what mysteries are those eyes that look
from behind that meaningful face hiding?

00:23:58.304 --> 00:24:03.342
Looks like we've got another
mystery on our hands!

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:12.318
Happy, happy, I'm always happy...

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:25.431
Where does happiness come from?

00:24:25.431 --> 00:24:30.703
I will go to you again today.

00:24:32.371 --> 00:24:39.278
Happiness comes
suddenly when I'm sleeping.

00:24:40.212 --> 00:24:43.082
If you're happy,

00:24:43.082 --> 00:24:47.853
show everyone by raising
your arms into the air!

00:24:49.455 --> 00:24:56.862
Happy, happy, I'm always happy.

00:24:57.229 --> 00:25:03.202
I wish that it would never end.

00:25:03.202 --> 00:25:11.944
Happy, happy, we are happy!

00:25:11.944 --> 00:25:16.482
Because I am loved...

00:25:18.283 --> 00:25:21.387
...forever!

00:25:24.189 --> 00:25:25.758
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:25:27.593 --> 00:25:29.795
Mr. Bo-bobo,
please make me your student!

00:25:29.795 --> 00:25:32.231
Very well. But the path
of wiggin' out is very harsh.

00:25:32.231 --> 00:25:34.233
Why are you trying to make
him a student of the wiggin' arts?

00:25:34.233 --> 00:25:36.702
| will submit to Mr. Bo-bobo's teaching.

00:25:36.935 --> 00:25:39.405
Then come with me
to the Nose Hair Dojo!

00:25:39.405 --> 00:25:41.640
Oh! Looks like this dojo
will make me stronger!

00:25:41.640 --> 00:25:44.276
Hold it! You're making a big mistake!

00:25:44.276 --> 00:25:46.045
Next time on Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo:

00:25:46.045 --> 00:25:46.345
"The Crane Maiden” of Betrayal
and Greed. Thanks for the Verse!

